OL,3,GNEWSAHow Keith Alexander blazed a trail
OL,4,Afor black football managers
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Keith Alexander died in 2010, he
OL,7,Fwas honoured up and down the country,
OL,8,Fincluding on one of football's biggest
OL,9,Fstages as England players donned black
OL,10,Farmbands for a match at Wembley.
OL,12,FIt was a fitting tribute to a man who
OL,13,Fwas not only an admired and respected
OL,14,Ffigure in the game, but a trailblazer
OL,15,Fwho helped pave the way for more black
OL,16,Fmanagers in English professional
OL,17,Ffootball.
OL,19,FAs part of Black History Month, those
OL,20,Fwho knew him best have been reflecting
OL,21,Fon his lasting impact.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
